(Cancellation of confirmed tickets) Tj T*
(For a confirmed ticket cancelled more than 48 hours before the scheduled departure of the train,) Tj T*
(the cancellation charge is a flat amount per passenger, plus GST on AC classes: Rs 240 for AC) Tj T*
(First Class and Executive Class, Rs 200 for AC 2-tier and First Class, Rs 180 for AC 3-tier, AC) Tj T*
(Chair Car and AC 3 Economy, Rs 120 for Sleeper Class and Rs 60 for Second Class. For a confirmed) Tj T*
(ticket cancelled between 48 hours and 12 hours before the scheduled departure, the charge is 25%) Tj T*
(of the fare, subject to the minimum flat charge for the class. For a confirmed ticket cancelled) Tj T*
(between 12 hours and 4 hours before the scheduled departure, the charge is 50% of the fare,) Tj T*
(subject to the minimum flat charge for the class. For a confirmed ticket cancelled less than 4) Tj T*
(hours before the scheduled departure, no refund is given.) Tj T*
